VaultRegistry::getVaultAtIndex(uint256)
├── given vault list is empty
│   └── when index is 0
│       └── it should revert with VaultRegistryInvalidIndex
├── given vault list has vaults
│   ├── when index is greater than or equal to vault list length
│   │   └── it should revert with VaultRegistryInvalidIndex
│   └── when index is less than vault list length
│       └── it should return the vault at the given index
